#3100
@CThe Riverward Concourse@n~
The northern wall of Midgaard rises close to the west while the broad southern concourse
opens toward the riverward district. Pale paving stones bear the wear of carts, patrol
boots, and generations of travelers passing between the city's halves. Iron lantern
brackets and carved civic markers give the street an orderly, well-kept character.
