The Riverward Promenade~
A broad promenade follows the river behind a low stone parapet. Old shade trees stand at
measured intervals between benches, and bargemen can be heard calling across the water
beyond the wall. The city feels less crowded here, with room for walkers, vendors, and
off-duty guards to linger.
