#3120
@C--< @WThe Skychain Crossing @C>--@n~
Five roads meet around an ancient iron anchor set deep into the paving. From it rises a
@Ccolossal black chain@n, each link broad as a shield, climbing impossibly into the
clouds. Old runes cut around the anchor flare faintly in bad weather, and locals give
the relic a respectful distance even as daily traffic flows around it.
