@YThe Civic Hall Antechamber@n~
Benches line the paneled walls of Midgaard's civic antechamber. Petitioners wait beneath
painted shields representing the city's wards while a long oak clerk's desk occupies the
center of the room. Ledgers, quills, sand shakers, and stacks of wax-sealed petitions
replace the noise of the streets outside.
